        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Corded white silk ground, on which are waving bands of ribbon; woven with white silk.  Curving in the opposite direction from these are bands of flowers and leaves woven with gold thread and narrow strips of metal, light and dark blue, green, and white silk.  Bunches of flowers woven in pink, green, red, white, and yellow silk and silver thread, spring from these bands."@en ;
